摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Evangelion-inspired theme plugin for DSH WebUI, featuring Unit-00, Unit-01, and Unit-02 themes with immersive backgrounds and mecha-style UI effects.","id":"gh:1333865824","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-eva-theme-plugin","slug":"oceanxuikun/dsh-eva-theme-plugin","topics":["dsh-plugin","dsh-plugins"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Evangelion-inspired theme plugin for DSH WebUI, featuring Unit-00, Unit-01, and Unit-02 themes with "},{"id":"p1s2","text":"immersive backgrounds and mecha-style UI effects."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-eva-theme-plugin"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A user-level client plugin that gives the DeepSeek Harness Web GUI three\nNeon Genesis Evangelion uni"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"t schemes — **初号機 (Unit-01)**, **零号機\n(Unit-00)**, **弐号機 (Unit-02)** — each retinting **every** page "},{"id":"p4s3","text":"element and\nshowing the active unit's art in the sidebar. Built entirely as a plugin:\n**no harness s"},{"id":"p4s4","text":" the active unit's art in the sidebar. Built entirely as a plugin:\n**no harness source is touched**."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## What it does"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- **Three switchable schemes**, all dark, each with a complete `--dsw-*`\ntoken set (86 tokens) so *a"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"ll* elements re-tint on switch — surfaces,\nlabels, buttons, states, bubbles, input bar, sidebar, scr"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"ollbars, code\nblocks, menus:\n- `eva-unit01` 初号機 — purple body (#b96bff) with neon-green accents\n- `e"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"va-unit00` 零号機 — blue-grey body, yellow accents (#ffc233)\n- `eva-unit02` 弐号機 — crimson body, orange "},{"id":"p6s5","text":"accents (#ff4b3a)\n- **Unit wallpaper backdrop** per scheme (embedded data URIs; wallhaven\nfan art, n"},{"id":"p6s6","text":"o baked-in text/watermarks), painted right of center behind the\napp with a left-side protection grad"},{"id":"p6s7","text":"ient so the chat column stays legible\nwhile the artwork shows through the translucent panels.\n- **Si"},{"id":"p6s8","text":"debar switcher** (wide): a mecha art banner for the active unit plus\nthree unit buttons, injected in"},{"id":"p6s9","text":"to the sidebar's `sidebar.footer.action`\nslot; collapsed rail mode shows three unit dots.\n- **EVA is"},{"id":"p6s10","text":" the enforced look**: on every `theme/change` the plugin re-asserts\nUnit-01 whenever the active them"},{"id":"p6s11","text":"e is not one of the three unit schemes\n(this also absorbs the async settings-adopt that would otherw"},{"id":"p6s12","text":"ise reset the\ntheme to light/dark at boot). The three unit buttons are the theme control.\n- **Mecha "},{"id":"p6s13","text":"chrome** (token-driven, re-tints per unit):\n- hazard warning stripes across the top edge of the view"},{"id":"p6s14","text":"port\n- HUD targeting brackets at the four viewport corners\n- subtle scanline + vignette overlay (mec"},{"id":"p6s15","text":"ha monitor feel)\n- blueprint grid in the backdrop (visible through the translucent panels)\n- square "},{"id":"p6s16","text":"mecha corners on the composer card + brand-colored top edge,\nbrand-glow header underline, brand edge"},{"id":"p6s17","text":" on the sidebar\n- sidebar switcher: chamfered (angle-cut) unit buttons, monospace\nletter-spaced labe"},{"id":"p6s18","text":"ls, hazard-stripe strip + `UNIT-0X` designation on the\nart banner"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Screenshots"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"### 初号機 (Unit-01)"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"### 零号機 (Unit-00)"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"### 弐号機 (Unit-02)"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Files"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| Path | Role |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| `package.json` | package identity + `dsh.client` declaration + exports |\n| `lib/index.js` | host h"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"alf (no-op) |\n| `client.js` | browser bundle: theme registry + backdrop + sidebar switcher |\n| `clie"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"nt.template.js` | readable bundle source (base64 placeholders) |\n| `assets/unit00.webp` · `unit01.we"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"bp` · `unit02.webp` | embedded artwork (webp) |\n| `assets/screenshot00.png` · `screenshot01.png` · `"},{"id":"p13s5","text":"screenshot02.png` | effect preview screenshots (Unit-00/01/02) |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Installation (via `dsh plugin`)"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"The package is a profile **bundle** (`dsh.bundle.patch`), so it installs with\nthe standard plugin co"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"mmand — no manual symlinks or patch edits:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"This runs `pnpm add` in the web profile, links the package into\n`~/.dsh/profiles/web/node_modules`, "},{"id":"p17s2","text":"and automatically appends\n`dsh-eva-theme-plugin` to `dsh.profile.bundles` in the profile's\n`package."},{"id":"p17s3","text":"json`. Restart `dsh web`, then refresh the page."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Rebuild after changing images or the template:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Uninstall"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Then restart `dsh web` and refresh."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Credits"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Artwork: fan art hosted on wallhaven.cc (see sources above), used as local\npersonal GUI backgrounds;"},{"id":"p24s2","text":" Neon Genesis Evangelion © Khara / GAINAX."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
